Q1  Plato's elements as books of triangles (Timaeus)
   triangles: fire 24, air 48, water 120 ; earth 24 (a different triangle)
   1 water -> 1 fire + 2 air   120.0 ->  120.0   conserved
   1 air -> 2 fire              48.0 ->   48.0   conserved
   2 fire -> 1 air              48.0 ->   48.0   conserved
   2.5 air -> 1 water          120.0 ->  120.0   conserved
   earth's triangle has angles 45-45-90, fire's 30-60-90: no whole number of one tiles the other's angles -> earth's book is separate

Q2  Plato's bond: fire : air = air : water = water : earth  (two means for solids)
   equal log steps for every a<b<30 with the two means; single-mean whole only when ab is a square: failures = 0

Q3  The world soul is a peel ladder
   peel of 2       = 1/3
   peel of 3/2     = 1/5
   peel of 4/3     = 1/7
   peel of 9/8     = 1/17
   peel of 256/243 = 13/499
   fifth (+) fourth = octave          1/3 = 1/3  exact
   tone (+) tone (+) leimma = fourth  1/7 = 1/7  exact
   fourth (+) tone = fifth            1/5 = 1/5  exact
   (n+1)/n -> 1/(2n+1) for n = 1..50: True

Q4  Plato's Lambda (1,2,4,8 and 1,3,9,27) is a two-book diamond
   fifth 3/2       = 2^-1 3^1 = 3/2 ; peel(2-book) (+) peel(3-book) = 1/5  match
   fourth 4/3      = 2^2 3^-1 = 4/3 ; peel(2-book) (+) peel(3-book) = 1/7  match
   tone 9/8        = 2^-3 3^2 = 9/8 ; peel(2-book) (+) peel(3-book) = 1/17  match
   leimma 256/243  = 2^8 3^-5 = 256/243 ; peel(2-book) (+) peel(3-book) = 13/499  match

Q5  The real nested bubbles, earth outward (radii, standard values; see report for sources)
   Earth                      -> magnetosphere (day side)   x 10  (1.00 decades)
   magnetosphere (day side)   -> Earth's Hill sphere        x 23.5  (1.37 decades)
   Earth's Hill sphere        -> heliosphere (heliopause)   x 1.21e+04  (4.08 decades)
   heliosphere (heliopause)   -> Oort cloud outer edge      x 826  (2.92 decades)
   Oort cloud outer edge      -> Local Bubble               x 316  (2.50 decades)
   Local Bubble               -> Milky Way disc             x 100  (2.00 decades)
   Milky Way disc             -> Milky Way halo (virial)    x 16.3  (1.21 decades)
   Milky Way halo (virial)    -> Local Group                x 6  (0.78 decades)
   Local Group                -> Laniakea                   x 53.3  (1.73 decades)
   mean step 1.95 decades, spread 1.00 -> constant step KILLED
   peel of each step ratio sits at 0.8182, 0.9185, 0.9998, 0.9976, 0.9937, 0.9802, 0.8844, 0.7143, 0.9632 (the halo-to-Local-Group step lands near the wall 0.7071 only because the halo radius is uncertain, 200-300 kpc: not a finding)

Q6  The largest scale is a foam of many-faced bubbles: mean faces of a random cell
   interior cells 1284: mean faces 15.578 (dodecahedron 12, Kelvin cell 14, icosahedron 20)
